.
.  Generate sample output for scatter plot matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na spmatr3.ps
device 2 postscript
.
SKIP 25
READ CURRIE.DAT ID1 ID2 FRWC CTOTAL POTASSIU LEAD IRON SULFEROX y7 y8 y9
SKIP 0
.
CHAR 1 2
LINE BLANK BLANK
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 5 5 95 92
SET SCATTER PLOT MATRIX FIT LOWESS
SET SCATTER PLOT MATRIX TAG ON
LOWESS FRACTION 0.6
TIC MARK LABEL SIZE 15
LABEL SIZE 15
CHAR SIZE 4 4
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 5 5
MAJOR TIC MARK NUMBER 3
.
SCATTER PLOT MATRIX FRWC CTOTAL POTASSIU LEAD IRON SULFEROX Y7 Y8 Y9 ID2 subset id2 > 1
.
MOVE 50 96
JUSTIFICATION CENTER
HEIGHT 3.5
TEXT 1979 Automobile Analysis
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv SPMATR3.PS spmatr3.ps
.
. quit
